flowchart TB
  subgraph RS[Reservation System]
    UI[Web UI\nrole: user/admin interaction]
    API[HTTP API Adapters\nrole: transport validation and response mapping]
    AUTH[Session & Authorization\nrole: authenticate actor\nowns: Session validity and role claims]
    RMS[Reservation Service\nrole: lifecycle, availability, approval\nowns: Reservation transitions and BR-02]
    PERSIST[Prisma Persistence Adapter\nrole: transactional storage access]
    DB[(SQLite\nowns: persisted Users, Sessions, Agents, Reservations)]

    UI -->|HTTP commands and queries| API
    API -->|verify actor| AUTH
    API -->|typed use-case calls| RMS
    AUTH -->|User/Session reads| PERSIST
    RMS -->|transactional reads/writes| PERSIST
    PERSIST -->|SQL| DB
  end
